    "title": "Luka Doncic points tonight: Spurs vs. Lakers stats, box score - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By James H. Williams ,\n16 minutes ago\nLuka Dončić led the charge for the Los Angeles Lakers in the first half against Victor Wembanyama and the San Antonio Spurs .\nHe pushed for a triple-double in the first half, finishing with 22 points, seven assists and six rebounds in just over 20 minutes of play. Dončić and the Lakers led 60-59 at halftime.\nDončić collected his fourth foul with eight minutes left in the third quarter, threatening a potentially strong finish due to foul trouble.\nHere's a breakdown of Dončić's latest performance:\nMore: World Series champion Dodgers take in Spurs vs. Lakers\nLuka Dončić stats tonight vs. Spurs ( Stats from first half; will be updated )\nPoints: 22 FG: 6-for-14 Free Throws : 8-for-11 Rebounds: 6 Assists: 7 Steals: 3 Blocks: 2 Turnovers: 1 Fouls: 3 Minutes: 20:06 This article originally appeared on USA TODAY: Luka Doncic points tonight: Spurs vs. Lakers stats, box score",
